      },
      "rev_n_1_6cb23c_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_6cb23c_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_6cb23c",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is correct in its logic but has a small error in the loop condition. The condition `n - m * p + 2` should be `n - m * p + 1` to include the last valid starting position. This oversight causes the function to miss the last possible valid q in some cases.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_6cb23c_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_0590443b51",
        "created_at": 1794537172.5651705
      },
      "rev_n_2_81748a_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_81748a_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_81748a",
        "thought_text": "The current approach of sorting both sequences and comparing their element frequencies is incorrect. Instead, we should directly compare the elements of b with the subsequence of a starting from each valid position q, without sorting. This approach will correctly handle cases where the elements in b are not in sorted order relative to each other.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_81748a_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_59658c9415",
        "created_at": 1794537200.5134425
      },
      "rev_n_3_24d3e3_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_24d3e3_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_24d3e3",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is correct in its logic but fails to account for the possibility of duplicate elements in sequence b. The hash table (Counter) comparison might incorrectly identify valid sequences when there are more occurrences of an element in b than in the corresponding subsequence of a. To address this, we should consider using a frequency array or a more sophisticated comparison method that accounts for the exact number of occurrences of each element in both sequences.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_24d3e3_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_f73caeba17",
        "created_at": 1794537230.9091318
      },
      "rev_n_4_e7e5bb_0": {
